{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03335","headline":"饯中书侍郎来济 · 宋之问","name":"饯中书侍郎来济","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暧暧去尘昏灞岸，飞飞轻盖指河梁。\n云峰衣结千重叶，雪岫花开几树粧。\n深悲黄鹤孤舟远，独对青山别路长。\n却将分手沾襟泪，还用持添离席觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}